candle-gen-sana is an independent, from-scratch Rust/candle reimplementation of
the SANA (NVlabs) text-to-image architecture — the DC-AE f32 deep-compression
autoencoder, the Linear-DiT trunk, and the gemma-2-2b-it CHI caption encoder
seam. It does not include or redistribute any model weights.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Model weights (NOT distributed with this crate)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Model weights are supplied by the caller. Neither this crate nor its examples
download them: inference never self-fetches and never derives a hub-cache
location (epic 13657). Both examples take a local snapshot directory you have
staged out-of-band — `--snapshot <dir>`, or the `SANA_SNAPSHOT` /
`SANA_SPRINT_SNAPSHOT` env var — and load it via `WeightsSource::Dir`. Those
weights are NOT part of this crate and remain subject to the licenses of their
